The GUI test of the tracker-breadcrumbs change (by jrash), adapted for
the fork, where the breadcrumbs are in the system's Tracker (milestone M16).

  . tools/haiku-arm64-env.sh
  $CXX -O2 $HAIKU_CPPFLAGS -I haiku/headers/private/app -o run/crumbinput \
      tools/tracker-breadcrumbs/crumbinput.cpp -lbe
  copy run/crumbinput and gui-test.sh into one folder on the board, turn on
  SingleWindowBrowse, ShowNavigator and ShowFullPathInTitleBar in
  ~/config/settings/Tracker/TrackerSettings (then kill -9 Tracker, so it
  doesn't write its old settings back), and run ./gui-test.sh <out folder>.
